  "text": "You have chosen a black sheath dress with a delicate cream lace bodice and a collar, creating a sober yet refined look suitable for mourning. The golden chain necklace adds a subtle touch of warmth without being ostentatious, while the structured black vest layered over your top provides necessary coverage and formality. To complete your ensemble, you have selected a compact black clutch to hold your essentials discreetly and classic black pumps with a modest heel that are comfortable enough for long hours. This entire outfit works as a unified silhouette because the dark tones of the dress, vest, shoes, and bag create a continuous vertical line that draws attention upward to your face, while the metallic accent on the jewelry breaks the darkness gently. It is appropriate for the early morning of this difficult day because it balances respect with comfort, allowing you to move steadily through the service without distraction.",
  "how_to_wear": [
    "Keep the collar of the dress neat and let the lace bodice sit comfortably against your skin; if you feel exposed by the sleeveless cut, lean into the simplicity rather than hiding it."
