      "n": "#154·33",
      "text": "This black sheath dress features a sleeveless bodice covered in intricate cream lace that ends just below the bustline, meeting a smooth skirt at the waist. It includes a modest collar and a clean silhouette that respects the solemnity of the occasion while maintaining elegance."
    },
    {
      "n": "#368·33",
      "text": "The necklace is a delicate chain crafted from small oval links in a soft golden hue, offering a gentle contrast against the black fabric of your dress without overpowering it."
    },
    {
      "n": "#462·15",
      "text": "This compact clutch bag has a structured rectangular shape with a flap front and subtle metal hardware, providing just enough space for essentials while remaining understated."
    },
    {
      "n": "#265·38",
      "text": "The vest is tailored in black fabric with button closures down the front and includes functional pockets at the hips; its structured fit adds definition to your upper body and ensures you are covered appropriately."
    },
